---

---
<div class="container">
    <!-- <h2>Past Experience</h2> -->
    <div class="columns">
        <div class="column">
            <hgroup>
                <h3>Customer Service Representative</h3> 
                <time datetime="2020">2020</time>-<time datetime="2021">2021</time>
                <p>Pacific Coast Producers</p>
            </hgroup>
            <ul>
                <li>Navigate through JDE, Qlikview, Order Change Log, Outlook, and Microsoft Office Programs</li>
                <li>Prepare monthly label inventory reports to send to customers</li>
                <li>Enclosure billing reports</li>
                <li>Process and audit orders</li>
                <li>Restock labels</li>
                <li>Manage daily stock shortages</li>
                <li>Communicate directly with broker/customer</li>
                <li>Work with the Sales Team when pricing and stock issues arise</li>
                <li>Assist the Marketing Team with creating salesheets with InDesign and updating product information on company website</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="column">
            <hgroup>
                <h3>Office Manager</h3> 
                <time datetime="2017">2017</time>-<time datetime="2019">2019</time>
                <p>Walker Veterinary Hospital</p>
            </hgroup>
            <ul>
                <li>Managed daily operations and schedules of employees</li>
                <li>Directly dealt with multiple venders</li>
                <li>Maintained detailed files of company accounts</li>
                <li>Implemented the shift to digital medical records</li>
                <li>Managed monthly accounts receivables</li>
                <li>Responsible for recruiting, hiring, performance reviews and necessary disciplinary actions.</li>
            </ul>

            <hgroup>
                <h3>Assistant Office Manager</h3> 
                <time datetime="2010">2010</time>-<time datetime="2017">2017</time>
                <p>Walker Veterinary Hospital</p>
            </hgroup>
            <ul>
                <li>Provide daily support to the Office Manager’s needs</li>
                <li>Counted daily till and created weekly deposits</li>
                <li>Maintained inventory and supplies</li>
                <li>Trained receptionists and kennel technicians</li>
                <li>Maintained office and lab equipment by running quality control</li>
                <li>Trained to open and close the office and building</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<style>
    .container {
		container: experience / inline-size;
    }
    h2 {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .columns {
        column-count: 2;
        column-width: 20ch;
        gap: 3rem;
        text-wrap: balance;
    }
    .column {
        break-after: column;
    }
    ul {
        margin-block-end: 3rem;
    }
    hgroup {
        margin-block-end: 1rem;
    }
    @container experience (width < 80ch) {
 
        .columns {
            column-count: 1;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        .column {
            break-after: avoid;
        }
    }
</style>